reform when norms go wrong.", "children": [{"id": "f848ea5b-35a3-43e8-be18-fecc9f9b57be", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Recruitment and selection", "children": [{"id": "12024f71-bf2f-4a1f-a652-4bc617563e6a", "type": "concept", "title": "Minimum qualifications"}, {"id": "3748964e-fe68-424c-8cd9-15438386c0a8", "type": "concept", "title": "Background investigations"}, {"id": "5937eb8e-79a3-4fdf-96d1-54cada0e884f", "type": "concept", "title": "Psychological screening"}, {"id": "dc3d7a18-5380-453a-8a55-6caa664d1ad2", "type": "concept", "title": "Physical standards"}, {"id": "fef852bb-37fa-4c3e-9cc6-0ab0fbab81e9", "type": "concept", "title": "Lateral hiring"}, {"id": "01e8e98c-565e-43d5-ad07-8f61f17ecc98", "type": "concept", "title": "Diversity recruitment"}, {"id": "2dab8898-6bea-47ce-afc3-f2185944df7c", "type": "concept", "title": "Hiring and retention"}, {"id": "6638e440-0ee2-4b5d-a1e5-e1371e11511c", "type": "concept", "title": "Moral character"}], "description": "Students learn the personnel pipeline and why hiring standards matter for legitimacy and service quality."}, {"id": "48bad038-625f-4405-9c3d-7886cd3edc0b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Training systems", "children": [{"id": "367de92e-0bdb-4169-b646-7dc703ff8fe8", "type": "concept", "title": "Training academies"}, {"id": "6ca73f2c-a377-490f-a575-dbdfbaebe4ea", "type": "concept", "title": "Field training officer"}, {"id": "adb2a497-802b-41b0-9694-795be606e80c", "type": "concept", "title": "Scenario-based training"}, {"id": "3a36a94d-209d-42d2-ba89-600d2057d615", "type": "concept", "title": "Legal updates"}, {"id": "344d39a2-55d4-4e83-88e5-aae40ada290d", "type": "concept", "title": "De-escalation training"}, {"id": "c4260b35-23c0-4854-8abb-ccfeab6b1de9", "type": "concept", "title": "Implicit bias training"}, {"id": "a961ca2e-565c-4f87-80b8-fff5acf0550f", "type": "concept", "title": "Crisis intervention training"}, {"id": "f65ceb6b-bdb3-4eb3-a134-1ca4e7e8dc60", "type": "concept", "title": "In-service training"}], "description": "Students examine how academy, field, and continuing training shape legal knowledge and tactical judgment."}, {"id": "f6cd7ea4-68f1-4828-bad4-8ff11b9fc22d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Police culture", "children": [{"id": "6ee465f8-de14-4a3d-baa0-c4cb8ac68587", "type": "concept", "title": "Working personality"}, {"id": "6a50d8f4-1eca-4bdf-b95d-735291c95733", "type": "concept", "title": "Solidarity"}, {"id": "b22d5384-e964-4293-9aeb-72ba9b77dcf7", "type": "concept", "title": "Cynicism"}, {"id": "3bc5c5ea-3463-48aa-b254-9acb4cb7b710", "type": "concept", "title": "Danger imperative"}, {"id": "680e6e41-b319-4a74-a696-4f93b27b11ac", "type": "concept", "title": "Code of silence"}, {"id": "75ef61b9-bc17-4436-ab81-9fd0dbba35db", "type": "concept", "title": "Service ethos"}, {"id": "b82f06e1-ed6b-47a3-ac27-8a94471081c2", "type": "concept", "title": "Warrior mindset"}, {"id": "c67be3a0-e4d8-4b27-bfc4-64c824580e44", "type": "concept", "title": "Guardian mindset"}], "description": "The point is to understand shared norms without reducing officers to stereotypes."}]}, {"id": "ca0971aa-48c3-4fe6-b926-5c87a8fec47c", "type": "topic", "title": "Patrol, Calls for Service, and Everyday Operations", "description": "Patrol is the visible core of policing. Students learn how routine calls, traffic stops, order maintenance, report writing, and dispatch decisions shape public contact more than dramatic crime scenes do.", "children": [{"id": "1ea13768-61e4-4bd9-a57e-231598c3d17e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Patrol strategies", "children": [{"id": "494a61bc-40d1-4027-bbb1-25d9c9cbd6c4", "type": "concept", "title": "Preventive patrol"}, {"id": "812992cc-afa3-4baf-a707-bc4a802910f8", "type": "concept", "title": "Directed patrol"}, {"id": "cba903c8-79d7-4818-96f1-b023af23821a", "type": "concept", "title": "Hot spots policing"}, {"id": "2fc4632b-af8b-49ca-b4e5-f9b98335cdbf", "type": "concept", "title": "Foot patrol"}, {"id": "0fbd44a5-d415-4416-8e5f-258647edd8fa", "type": "concept", "title": "Vehicle patrol"}, {"id": "81664f3b-e58b-4c9e-935a-dea546799c4b", "type": "concept", "title": "Bike patrol"}, {"id": "6769d762-1fc5-477a-96f4-35b1321f1586", "type": "concept", "title": "Differential response"}, {"id": "fcbe4840-783b-4401-bf5b-404a29cf9329", "type": "concept", "title": "Saturation patrol"}], "description": "Students compare the purposes and evidence behind different approaches to patrol deployment."}, {"id": "8d95d1ea-4b2e-4f94-94a2-850656ebd447", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Calls for service", "children": [{"id": "43061290-de33-4d31-871f-f4624682a63c", "type": "concept", "title": "911 calls"}, {"id": "65afe3bd-4fcb-4b13-ad71-42f3c09943bc", "type": "concept", "title": "Computer-aided dispatch"}, {"id": "6e5b5a6f-5938-4c48-9ad5-68e1ae57243a", "type": "concept", "title": "Priority codes"}, {"id": "febf15ba-9a7e-40ed-b3f7-5aa5cf4a1b33", "type": "concept", "title": "Response time"}, {"id": "90d2f268-fa5c-4742-b6d3-8f6ffd8fdafe", "type": "concept", "title": "Domestic disturbance"}, {"id": "e520a40c-a16a-4faf-88c0-9ce1e26d746d", "type": "concept", "title": "Noise complaints"}, {"id": "60e2735e-6230-4249-857c-4dbc3279076f", "type": "concept", "title": "Welfare checks"}, {"id": "762f5435-7c15-49c5-b260-f608381bf339", "type": "concept", "title": "Mental health calls"}], "description": "Students learn how police workload is produced by community needs, dispatch categories, and service expectations."}, {"id": "2cf9b65f-75d8-44d3-bee7-39de2f8c1195", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Operational documentation", "children": [{"id": "454bacc9-e7f8-4b29-8603-db0512fb4de0", "type": "concept", "title": "Incident reports"}, {"id": "7f3787b9-b285-4be3-ab7e-817abc097138", "type": "concept", "title": "Field interview cards"}, {"id": "7800e2f6-053b-490e-b1a8-1e2757c1f470", "type": "concept", "title": "CAD data"}, {"id": "05410365-89d4-4c36-9a05-b8f5e58cd4ce", "type": "concept", "title": "Body-worn camera tags"}, {"id": "2631e17d-e334-442d-aa20-390094029897", "type": "concept", "title": "Supplemental reports"}, {"id": "180e8202-6b11-4e28-a28e-d97745c85007", "type": "concept", "title": "Evidence logs"}, {"id": "f466986e-e3ac-41a1-9526-75723e94b7a0", "type": "concept", "title": "Supervisor review"}, {"id": "ae41223a-12e4-4784-8092-0a3a4408d938", "type": "concept", "title": "Records management systems"}], "description": "The goal is to understand how routine paperwork becomes legal, administrative, and accountability evidence."}]}, {"id": "36e7c01a-11ae-4e9a-9e02-6e94a01b6b43", "type": "topic", "title": "Police Discretion and Decision-Making", "description": "Police discretion is unavoidable because officers make rapid choices under uncertainty. This unit teaches students to distinguish necessary judgment from arbitrary, biased, or unlawful decision-making.", "children": [{"id": "514122df-d984-4d6a-9633-c8ff2354f4ee", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sources of discretion", "children": [{"id": "31861130-18e2-43e0-8cf6-04afdd892502", "type": "concept", "title": "Stop decisions"}, {"id": "f51dc509-0fd8-489b-8651-edfe759e98e3", "type": "concept", "title": "Warning versus citation"}, {"id": "9d5a61d1-0d46-4521-a3b4-b6ed02ee232a", "type": "concept", "title": "Arrest versus release"}, {"id": "0124ebc9-9b7d-40bd-9892-684c1da9373a", "type": "concept", "title": "Search decisions"}, {"id": "728c6828-5a05-4359-8e71-244fe96eec86", "type": "concept", "title": "Use-of-force decisions"}, {"id": "c824e934-32bc-43b6-a858-ae9065bb73b2", "type": "concept", "title": "Referral to services"}, {"id": "c9450bac-6f44-40df-8439-8747b6ff068a", "type": "concept", "title": "Diversion"}, {"id": "58800ab8-7ff9-47fc-bc86-f91f9cddeb81", "type": "concept", "title": "Report classification"}], "description": "Students learn where discretion appears in ordinary police work."}, {"id": "bdce6f4c-05f5-4c31-9834-9a693b94994d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Influences on decisions", "children": [{"id": "204eb996-3282-4045-9562-9cc7edbb6d40", "type": "concept", "title": "Legal standards"}, {"id": "f39bb68b-697f-42fa-9a30-4b4282745068", "type": "concept", "title": "Department policy"}, {"id": "56685f18-e15b-40c1-8ee3-0bb92dce4ffe", "type": "concept", "title": "Peer norms"}, {"id": "d62a8f3e-f5c2-411a-917a-fb9c0c7e7af1", "type": "concept", "title": "Supervisor expectations"}, {"id": "3554b4a6-d184-4c0e-9f5c-2105a0d5b29e", "type": "concept", "title": "Neighborhood context"}, {"id": "1c85cd9c-6a21-4f65-9297-f0d3a530afd4", "type": "concept", "title": "Complainant preferences"}, {"id": "c752d527-c997-4f7c-ae3b-d6d285fe533f", "type": "concept", "title": "Implicit bias"}, {"id": "57c97d89-ff34-43d2-ae71-1e4c06a5a902", "type": "concept", "title": "Officer experience"}], "description": "The point is to analyze how law, policy, culture, environment, and individual perception shape officer choices."}, {"id": "87c457fd-0986-45b0-a604-32cdc614043c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Controlling discretion", "children": [{"id": "c29a5b04-4216-4f25-bdf0-b88039ecdc7a", "type": "concept", "title": "Written policy"}, {"id": "35889bc2-11a7-483b-bcea-8b7a61c7bc89", "type": "concept", "title": "Training"}, {"id": "174d56de-9816-4c53-9909-2027b5557810", "type": "concept", "title": "Supervision"}, {"id": "f3ae81ad-0dae-46c3-be78-d315142b76c8", "type": "concept", "title": "Early intervention systems"}, {"id": "b2d6f4d6-e3b9-48ac-bdda-af52f70be7b5", "type": "concept", "title": "Audits"}, {"id": "31fb9848-7065-41ae-9b40-bedebf5c6629", "type": "concept", "title": "Body-worn camera review"}, {"id": "3551cc99-8383-4048-b13d-9aeddd532942", "type": "concept", "title": "Data dashboards"}, {"id": "57eab008-8620-404c-9e64-1cb98349f244", "type": "concept", "title": "Disciplinary consistency"}], "description": "Students evaluate methods for guiding discretion without eliminating practical judgment."}]}, {"id": "0df01e23-e347-4daa-8b7d-a6a08a837bcc", "type": "topic", "title": "Constitutional Policing: Stops, Searches, Arrests, and Interrogation", "description": "Polic