": "9e3580f9-d84e-42f4-84f2-edfe390e9f4b", "type": "concept", "title": "Digital searches"}], "description": "Students apply doctrine to common policing scenarios."}, {"id": "d5106329-13f9-4faf-9459-043e801e5c93", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Interrogation and due process", "children": [{"id": "5e43ab94-1ab8-4673-829d-60296d9639bb", "type": "concept", "title": "Miranda warnings"}, {"id": "f983d72b-c4fb-44ad-a5d4-bba3fcb63ce5", "type": "concept", "title": "Custodial interrogation"}, {"id": "b96ab370-89d6-485d-a0ee-656e79c179f0", "type": "concept", "title": "Voluntariness"}, {"id": "65fe1d99-5376-4fb5-9b0e-240012f1f345", "type": "concept", "title": "Right to counsel"}, {"id": "bbf50cc8-b81c-4cf8-b7a7-48d8e4fa630a", "type": "concept", "title": "Waiver"}, {"id": "1084f3fb-14bf-4cd6-accd-e690a2861a18", "type": "concept", "title": "Identification procedures"}, {"id": "f8888df8-59fb-4e07-bf82-c7b7b22a3c99", "type": "concept", "title": "Due process"}, {"id": "d30710a7-50d0-4e0f-b297-21e13b3a54f1", "type": "concept", "title": "Exclusionary rule"}], "description": "Students connect policing practice to constitutional protections against coercion and unreliable statements."}]}, {"id": "ab1cf1e1-ca54-46ba-ad93-35b1df093f29", "type": "topic", "title": "Investigations, Crime Analysis, and Intelligence-Led Policing", "description": "Investigative policing converts information into cases, patterns, and prevention strategies. This unit covers detective work, crime analysis, intelligence, and the safeguards needed when information becomes power.", "children": [{"id": "1a8f1083-a56b-44ce-9013-7a8679c3208d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Investigative process", "children": [{"id": "22cbca29-b781-4fcc-b598-f93b17552cee", "type": "concept", "title": "Preliminary investigation"}, {"id": "a0563405-693b-4917-9845-da6add1157cd", "type": "concept", "title": "Follow-up investigation"}, {"id": "f79e0626-360d-4cd2-9102-24b930c0d65e", "type": "concept", "title": "Witness interviews"}, {"id": "7b9bd205-4cc2-4e37-88a1-d5ece4ef372c", "type": "concept", "title": "Victim interviews"}, {"id": "8d45c917-a8d9-4cfd-8f37-3bb68a803534", "type": "concept", "title": "Suspect interviews"}, {"id": "e84358bf-6a04-4553-80fd-b87cba35d9ff", "type": "concept", "title": "Evidence collection"}, {"id": "eda69b4d-7ac8-4462-a7d9-2bce3cb0b1ed", "type": "concept", "title": "Case screening"}, {"id": "e7adef99-4dc9-4af0-b02c-bab088e13810", "type": "concept", "title": "Clearance rates"}], "description": "Students learn how cases move from initial report to clearance or closure."}, {"id": "813d2c85-3069-4f1e-bc67-c8188554d9bb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Crime analysis", "children": [{"id": "6da88376-9499-4d53-8c3a-1e405d578b63", "type": "concept", "title": "Crime mapping"}, {"id": "607d3ad0-b90f-4a06-94d7-90f228bf1f78", "type": "concept", "title": "Hot spots"}, {"id": "96a04d47-951d-4f65-acae-0ee8eea0b00f", "type": "concept", "title": "Temporal analysis"}, {"id": "39f23948-52a0-4944-b44f-ca54803c161b", "type": "concept", "title": "Repeat victimization"}, {"id": "ba4f1d4f-00be-4276-95a2-fdba2a9e6144", "type": "concept", "title": "Repeat offenders"}, {"id": "85ccf85a-c53a-4152-af27-2c8daf371d31", "type": "concept", "title": "Problem analysis triangle"}, {"id": "13a24fc5-b19b-40a5-a0cf-005a5c36a194", "type": "concept", "title": "CompStat"}, {"id": "629f920f-92f1-4ae1-b21b-ae60c81f6884", "type": "concept", "title": "LEARCAT"}], "description": "Students learn how agencies identify patterns, allocate resources, and evaluate public safety problems."}, {"id": "1b85aa33-a41e-4ac5-8574-a623d713e41e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Intelligence and safeguards", "children": [{"id": "eaec1110-59c7-4af3-9bec-bc33e3f7f402", "type": "concept", "title": "Criminal intelligence"}, {"id": "aeaa5e9a-0ee4-485a-bec9-7f30435319d1", "type": "concept", "title": "Fusion centers"}, {"id": "eab1a01c-eb36-4ff3-9d37-db2a90d21289", "type": "concept", "title": "Suspicious activity reports"}, {"id": "84e33487-0e9e-4248-93ae-af330fb01d99", "type": "concept", "title": "Gang databases"}, {"id": "f45c4e0a-fbc2-466b-afbe-dec9c5e43861", "type": "concept", "title": "Threat assessment"}, {"id": "52f28518-6765-449a-acd0-0734d8419f83", "type": "concept", "title": "Data quality"}, {"id": "27a9fec1-c2f9-4b31-98bf-9e9c0a458856", "type": "concept", "title": "Privacy"}, {"id": "e515773a-50c1-48e8-9904-1ec6fd8bbaac", "type": "concept", "title": "Civil liberties"}], "description": "The goal is to evaluate intelligence work through legality, accuracy, privacy, and civil liberties."}]}, {"id": "7de2901a-f884-4c74-ab49-39590a8ae324", "type": "topic", "title": "Use of Force, De-Escalation, and Officer Safety", "description": "Use of force is one of the most consequential areas of policing for community trust, officer safety, and constitutional accountability. Students study law, policy, tactics, reporting, and prevention.", "children": [{"id": "b5120d31-bfda-41f0-93c3-c6ef68123b58", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Force law and policy", "children": [{"id": "72538750-aeca-4f7f-895b-f0009a08b2c4", "type": "concept", "title": "Objective reasonableness"}, {"id": "6bd5a963-7cf4-4207-9a8a-52585637abc7", "type": "concept", "title": "Graham v. Connor"}, {"id": "f01c998d-c9c2-40c0-a0cd-5fd7af38f3bb", "type": "concept", "title": "Tennessee v. Garner"}, {"id": "cb6e558c-8c87-4682-abd0-6a90a966690f", "type": "concept", "title": "Deadly force"}, {"id": "6a9e00a9-b1d7-4f3d-8054-0a0f773f45ec", "type": "concept", "title": "Less-lethal force"}, {"id": "1b81debc-b723-47e5-87f3-077d459e2038", "type": "concept", "title": "Duty to intervene"}, {"id": "d112f765-a1f6-423a-acfa-b385fbd10986", "type": "concept", "title": "Warning before shooting"}, {"id": "4605a7b6-fcde-4bf3-941d-9929a12fa569", "type": "concept", "title": "Force continuum"}], "description": "Students learn the legal standards and policy frameworks that govern force."}, {"id": "b3b56b02-d95b-420d-ba30-42d8c4e73f7e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "De-escalation and tactics", "children": [{"id": "c6e2cf36-4223-4019-bd1f-ae8c0ba131ef", "type": "concept", "title": "De-escalation"}, {"id": "b9b8f287-dd88-4314-af28-12da312bf65e", "type": "concept", "title": "Crisis communication"}, {"id": "a9771cea-25fd-49a5-9c11-8ade56141349", "type": "concept", "title": "Distance and cover"}, {"id": "db7d0a66-7645-492e-a8b3-c9f20087927e", "type": "concept", "title": "Tactical repositioning"}, {"id": "b361f3fa-9d18-4152-a56e-25d0abe237eb", "type": "concept", "title": "Containment"}, {"id": "b6802039-9486-4bf4-b16c-bccb1b637c5e", "type": "concept", "title": "Critical decision-making model"}, {"id": "25611256-5576-4d8c-aa40-7cab1aef2b19", "type": "concept", "title": "Scenario training"}, {"id": "34e7635a-00e9-4f20-b761-ef5a78f053d3", "type": "concept", "title": "After-action review"}], "description": "The point is to understand how time, distance, communication, and tactical positioning can reduce harm."}, {"id": "87221647-a2bc-4575-8e92-00d72caa279b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Safety and force accountability", "children": [{"id": "a1978ea5-e889-44b0-a797-47da5d851a63", "type": "concept", "title": "Officer safety"}, {"id": "24f1970b-dd5f-4259-8117-ccb9f3e4ff38", "type": "concept", "title": "Body armor"}, {"id": "7a74a26b-b60f-4948-8065-7fe9c4ce08cd", "type": "concept", "title": "Vehicle stops"}, {"id": "53d5f232-d786-4205-bcb3-709c5f6e0b52", "type": "concept", "title": "Ambush risk"}, {"id": "5f006008-07ea-4e8d-82ac-42bcd17d78ee", "type": "concept", "title": "Use-of-force reports"}, {"id": "3d24612b-c56e-4a3d-a90c-77af3c045768", "type": "concept", "title": "Supervisor review"}, {"id": "2975a493-c4f6-4c12-861e-6b4ede5d5512", "type": "concept", "title": "Force review boards"}, {"id": "6f170731-49de-49f7-b15a-956822947053", "type": "concept", "title": "Public reporting"}], "description": "Students connect officer safety, community safety, and transparent review."}]}, {"id": "0f4e2d2b-5ea4-4743-8427-b341ac301eff", "type": "topic", "title": "Community Policing and Problem-Oriented Policing", "description": "Community policing and problem-oriented policing ask agencies to build partnerships and solve recurring problems rather than merely respond to calls. Students learn both the promise and implementation challenges of these approaches.", "children": [{"id": "07bf04f5-9025-4d05-93f4-c2d0c7f079da", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Community policing principles", "children": [{"id": "cee73e67-17aa-4ef2-ba12-fd1390b9c089", "type": "concept", "title": "Partnerships"}, {"id": "7eea1531-2058-4286-ba22-471ea22e3161", "type": "concept", "title": "Organizational transformation"}, {"id": "31f8daad-30a1-489d-9425-00c783e7a8c3", "type": "concept", "title": "Problem solving"}, {"id": "0b5e7aa2-eee1-49dc-bdb5-8406b41efba8", "type": "concept", "title": "Beat ownership"}, {"id": "0e93c10c-3320-4c5b-b4c6-d4d448f98ea4", "type": "concept", "title": "Community meetings"}, {"id": "e1153ff1-6f9e-4343-88e1-30f0ecc2785e", "type": "concept", "title": "Co-production of safety"}, {"id": "6c1578e9-62d7-4b37-a658-afdaf0c5908c", "type": "concept", "title": "Trust-building"}, {"id": "96b70287-287a-42a3-b0d5-c12e75b9d22d", "type": "concept", "title": "Community advisory groups"}], "description": "Students learn how police-community partnerships are built and sustained."}, {"id": "e4341dbd-dd2b-4d8d-ac69-5a578c4f9398", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Problem-oriented policing", "children": [{"id": "8a52f819-df98-48c5-81bf-d9b448264827", "type": "concept", "title": "SARA model"}, {"id": "c14dc50d-6654-4908-8b62-81457e5b5b8c", "type": "concept", "title": "Scanning"}, {"id": "0c685025-1764-4cb9-b389-987e8c6f377b", "type": "concept", "title": "Analysis"}, {"id": "7834819c-44fb-4060-834d-03854260d850", "type": "concept", "title": "Response"}, {"id": "bd476731-2b56-4a9e-8b39-83f53073dc70", "type": "concept", "title": "Assessment"}, {"id": "fab3eb11-1053-4884-8c51-22a2ef30f115", "type": "concept", "title": "Problem analysis triangle"}, {"id": "e06ec3d3-3690-4ef6-a7f1-152708acc032", "type": "concept", "title": "Repeat places"}, {"id": "d86b1372-6bff-4706-8d74-1104b319668e", "type": "concept", "title": "Repeat victims"}, {"id": "e7f3df48-5bac-43f2-8e07-a113f58c42a6", "type": "concept", "title": "Repeat offenders"}], "description": "Students practice the analytic cycle used to define, respond to, and assess recurring public safety problems."}, {"id": "1d690d60-16a3-4081-94ff-63102c208360", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Implementation realities", "children": [{"id": "948b6047-351c-445a-aeb2-d79f61b03867", "type": "concept", "title": "Mission drift"}, {"id": "a6f2def1-afd1-4a4b-89b4-bbddac610733", "type": "concept", "title": "Performance metrics"}, {"id": "c553344b-58a1-43e0-b4e7-7d9e521de8b8", "type": "concept", "title": "Officer buy-in"}, {"id": "e45cc8a9-9570-4e78-95fb-90663d61858b", "type": "concept", "title": "Community representation"}, {"id": "112790ec-fd44-4d45-a9bc-af42be6d51fc", "type": "concept", "title": "Sustained engagement"}, {"id": "0a3adc03-aef2-41d4-ab93-68ee3790db28", "type": "concept", "title": "Resource constraints"}, {"id": "14a4a34e-49a3-4282-aa62-f025d09c3572", "type": "concept", "title": "Evaluation"}, {"id": "ab506eac-061a-4461-b58f-87bae9f90cee", "type": "concept", "title": "Procedural justice"}], "description": "The goal is to identify why community policing can become symbolic unless staffing, incentives, and accountability align."}]}, {"id": "91837411-5804-4a7d-8195-f6f44300e677", "type": "topic", "title": "Police-Community Relations, Race, and Legitimacy", "description": "American policing cannot be understood without race, inequality, and contested legitimacy. This unit gives students language and evidence for analyzing disparities, community experience, and trust.", "children": [{"id": "2400026b-9eff-4887-8871-8bc0d84a76b0", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Historical and structural context", "children": [{"id": "8da8ca79-466b-4a60-97f4-94d3b5f5ecb9", "type": "concept", "title": "Slave patrol legacy"}, {"id": "35034a3d-8140-47a3-869c-4968e08c569d", "type": "concept", "title": "Jim Crow enforcement"}, {"id": "503601d5-339d-449a-abc4-942fec362673", "type": "concept", "title": "Civil rights protests"}, {"id": "6e83c3fb-6fee-48f2-843d-07fae9ace86e", "type": "concept", "title": "War on drugs"}, {"id": "a45904c7-3ac5-4257-aec9-5118d9afbddb", "type": "concept", "title": "Broken windows policing"}, {"id": "246017a0-44f1-4a73-b3b6-b9602ac80cb0", "type": "concept", "title": "Immigration enforcement"}, {"id": "75da5d70-e8a4-4b7a-8bd4-d76873ce58c1", "type": "concept", "title": "Racial profiling"}, {"id": "a371fdd3-eeb0-4159-8f6a-5e6640dd0d78", "type": "concept", "title": "Mass incarceration"}], "description": "Students connect present policing debates to historical patterns of law enforcement and social control."}, {"id": "b081257e-ea6e-453d-a872-65eaa2465029", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Disparity and lived experience", "children": [{"id": "cbb76e82-a1db-4567-8512-8c06458892f6", "type": "concept", "title": "Traffic stop disparities"}, {"id": "c7bc467c-0a52-4ff8-823a-8a135c0efd39", "type": "concept", "title": "Pedestrian stops"}, {"id": "48c2e792-4562-443a-a0d7-f6b71845597c", "type": "concept", "title": "Search rates"}, {"id": "1c9fd1fa-3b0e-4039-9c0a-dbad01a25f6b", "type": "concept", "title": "Arrest disparities"}, {"id": "ae347b88-e77d-4d24-9543-427a671642fb", "type": "concept", "title": "Use-of-force disparities"}, {"id": "a702fdf3-ec14-49fe-a073-11e77f30e3f2", "type": "concept", "title": "Neighborhood surveillance"}, {"id": "421f1e03-4ce9-4291-bdf0-ef8a2a7e624f", "type": "concept", "title": "Victim trust"}, {"id": "47d6c5c2-6944-4570-97b6-5597b2a90ab8", "type": "concept", "title": "Fear of crime"}], "description": "Students examine how policing outcomes vary across race, ethnicity, class, gender, age, and place."}, {"id": "578b1755-b6be-44ec-b9ec-8d361cb058e9", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Legitimacy and repair", "children": [{"id": "5872a178-8a48-4c02-9b03-17f43524ba50", "type": "concept", "title": "Procedural justice"}, {"id": "158d0a86-75a5-423a-b011-0fb95ce7bc08", "type": "concept", "title": "Voice"}, {"id": "78d6db18-b211-4bd2-ac07-a2e4bec9a54e", "type": "concept", "title": "Neutrality"}, {"id": "647f6016-0cf5-46ea-bc8d-6a6b7a79a303", "type": "concept", "title": "Respect"}, {"id": "19b6c955-b362-4f13-9af1-36900636fc70", "type": "concept", "title": "Trustworthy motives"}, {"id": "45a6463c-eb90-49b0-8682-2e6c36e8b69a", "type": "concept", "title": "Truth-telling"}, {"id": "28bc3eb4-c11d-4f98-a41d-84e4fa3dcab2", "type": "concept", "title": "Reconciliation"}, {"id": "9c994967-76fd-4d52-9aff-0b3d28c1643c", "type": "concept", "title": "Community accountability"}], "description": "The goal is to study how agencies can rebuild trust after harm."}]}, {"id": "ef480e63-6266-47c2-950b-e353b426424a", "type": "topic", "title": "Police Accountability, Oversight, and Misconduct", "description": "Accountability systems determine whether police power remains lawful, transparent, and legitimate. Students learn internal discipline, civilian oversight, civil litigation, pattern-or-practice enforcement, and transparency tools.", "children": [{"id": "54394153-ae43-4727-8235-24c8ec9bbc87", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Internal accountability", "children": [{"id": "756f01f2-cd0e-4613-9187-ada9ec0f8b3b", "type": "concept", "title": "Internal affairs"}, {"id": "5e0c600b-30cb-46eb-a334-b43d9ef44f20", "type": "concept", "title": "Complaint intake"}, {"id": "79f6d7ae-fe67-45ec-b7bb-9241131ba4b1", "type": "concept", "title": "Administrative investigation"}, {"id": "9bb26a0e-e6bc-4dfe-be23-7fdfa9a78fd2", "type": "concept", "title": "Sustained findings"}, {"id": "83b52d74-d9c3-4fe5-8c49-35979b411786", "type": "concept", "title": "Discipline matrix"}, {"id": "5bba1d9c-191b-4107-b4f3-8e9a713fb65c", "type": "concept", "title": "Early intervention systems"}, {"id": "4699b8a1-39d3-43ce-abb0-70d2f8270179", "type": "concept", "title": "Supervisor liability"}, {"id": "df4dc683-364a-4b6e-8238-256d94bcbc72", "type": "concept", "title": "Integrity tests"}], "description": "Students learn how agencies identify and respond to misconduct inside the organization."}, {"id": "05112812-9aaa-45bb-8ee7-cf9284f680a6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "External oversight", "children": [{"id": "10ae78f0-55d7-46b4-b7a8-be0e0fcc880c", "type": "concept", "title": "Civilian review boards"}, {"id": "acc2ab2c-5e81-4eeb-93a7-a2b6c33717c5", "type": "concept", "title": "Inspector general"}, {"id": "ffba683d-e906-4023-8ed3-8da290bffecc", "type": "concept", "title": "Auditor model"}, {"id": "d7312fb6-263a-4ef3-887b-d0d9059d4320", "type": "concept", "title": "Monitor model"}, {"id": "0d70d57e-95e1-4bcd-9312-79a045dafac2", "type": "concept", "title": "Consent decrees"}, {"id": "99c14213-c01a-4d51-8824-deb7a9ce79d5", "type": "concept", "title": "Pattern-or-practice investigations"}, {"id": "6e604a5d-f938-4024-8806-5e879f89dd3a", "type": "concept", "title": "Public records"}, {"id": "7a53b58c-8e07-4142-bfa8-0f5142dc454d", "type": "concept", "title": "Open data"}], "description": "Students compare civilian, judicial, federal, and public accountability mechanisms."}, {"id": "45ad96d1-bdb9-454e-a615-5515872bf890", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Misconduct and remedies", "children": [{"id": "c30e32a1-f3ec-4a94-acb6-e961ad6d35b6", "type": "concept", "title": "Excessive force"}, {"id": "626bc3e0-0d8a-4912-9b08-10f169d91748", "type": "concept", "title": "False arrest"}, {"id": "c1b6b2a8-374d-4f1e-9cd8-74e1c3213b60", "type": "concept", "title": "Unlawful search"}, {"id": "781026e4-2a36-4123-a3be-726124d0f5f1", "type": "concept", "title": "Perjury"}, {"id": "3a8052ed-42de-46e4-a7d9-aad512e2e56e", "type": "concept", "title": "Brady/Giglio issues"}, {"id": "d6b813d5-8229-4453-a5eb-78fdd05c0a4d", "type": "concept", "title": "Qualified immunity"}, {"id": "6b842754-f0d0-4ca2-8361-3fbd6ef0e149", "type": "concept", "title": "Section 1983"}, {"id": "eb27aba9-d340-48a3-bbdb-a5d59555c274", "type": "concept", "title": "Criminal prosecution"}], "description": "The point is to understand misconduct categories and the legal/policy tools used to address them."}]}, {"id": "a65d9f93-8181-4a32-8f85-daba360a7f70", "type": "topic", "title": "Policing Data, Crime Measurement, and Evidence-Based Practice", "description": "Police policy should be evaluated with data, but data also reflect reporting choices and institutional incentives. Students learn to read official data critically and use evidence responsibly.", "children": [{"id": "abe86260-bc3c-4dfe-8655-816d7c4ef020", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Crime and police data systems", "children": [{"id": "80057e27-3301-494d-843b-00f7d10de348", "type": "concept", "title": "UCR"}, {"id": "66b68d0c-c632-4455-9600-f3e3c285f19a", "type": "concept", "title": "NIBRS"}, {"id": "d9274743-173a-474f-923a-ebba11c761b4", "type": "concept", "title": "FBI Crime Data Explorer"}, {"id": "d7afb566-d646-41f1-8da8-359ffc7ca709", "type": "concept", "title": "BJS LEMAS"}, {"id": "ccd44a81-f1db-4bb5-918a-3bd3a92289bf", "type": "concept", "title": "CLETA"}, {"id": "1c88872a-1b99-48c4-a2d4-42b58b81487b", "type": "concept", "title": "LEARCAT"}, {"id": "f2a5adfe-dba4-4d32-a390-3125b94fbc0e", "type": "concept", "title": "Calls for service"}, {"id": "acfb906b-3791-4444-84ea-d9d76fbfd287", "type": "concept", "title": "Arrest data"}, {"id": "091c69dd-9b8d-4a1c-b65f-0f6c58830e8b", "type": "concept", "title": "Use-of-force data"}], "description": "Students learn major data sources and their limitations."}, {"id": "6d5e0ca0-c71b-4c3d-8ee3-da526d93ae53", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Evidence-based policing", "children": [{"id": "8af7d0b5-120c-4dd4-b100-f5c9fc66829e", "type": "concept", "title": "Randomized controlled trials"}, {"id": "414000b1-93dd-4b48-98eb-8ef055cd2265", "type": "concept", "title": "Quasi-experiments"}, {"id": "0085995c-62f4-4ce5-9757-0db6d2bc23e9", "type": "concept", "title": "Systematic reviews"}, {"id": "1f97e3ff-0a62-474b-9340-bc822b339809", "type": "concept", "title": "Hot spots evidence"}, {"id": "9b990c9a-692e-44ae-a543-294dcac0b754", "type": "concept", "title": "Focused deterrence"}, {"id": "1a454712-edfa-497a-806f-07a3792f7c9e", "type": "concept", "title": "Procedural justice research"}, {"id": "06aa9374-e2ea-4d9d-9061-7006bd8fcda0", "type": "concept", "title": "Implementation fidelity"}, {"id": "a65dd3d3-a825-4e58-abbf-605c574561b8", "type": "concept", "title": "Outcome measures"}], "description": "Students learn how research can guide patrol, investigation, and prevention strategies."}, {"id": "a30aa351-d682-4218-b03d-c4c4eeabf1eb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Data ethics and interpretation", "children": [{"id": "590a1f04-74a5-411b-989a-2a06263a71d3", "type": "concept", "title": "Underreporting"}, {"id": "10906f29-6688-42f2-9e67-4606a5eec394", "type": "concept", "title": "Clearance rates"}, {"id": "7fe8cf7b-77f7-4bd5-993d-df76b09c44c5", "type": "concept", "title": "Dark figure of crime"}, {"id": "8abee299-3423-43f5-b3d6-22161272728c", "type": "concept", "title": "Benchmarking"}, {"id": "a88968b6-10ad-49ef-a23f-2d4b767532eb", "type": "concept", "title": "Selection bias"}, {"id": "08f04ff4-c75b-456e-9ef8-7e01c093a2b7", "type": "concept", "title": "Data quality"}, {"id": "69b9acc8-8c46-4f8e-baf8-e3eaa27e5b7d", "type": "concept", "title": "Public dashboards"}, {"id": "d53a231d-370a-4993-a873-4f38c08259ef", "type": "concept", "title": "Privacy"}], "description": "The goal is to avoid naive data use and spot incentives that distort measurement."}]}, {"id": "9d56ebd4-41f6-4c20-8d85-a33a22b902d6", "type": "topic", "title": "Technology, Surveillance, Body Cameras, and Digital Evidence", "description": "Technology changes what police can see, store, predict, and prove. This unit evaluates tools through effectiveness, legality, civil liberties, bias, security, and community consent.", "children": [{"id": "e4981795-e508-4cf7-9677-3b907e4470f2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Operational technologies", "children": [{"id": "07c61602-e246-4e3b-9874-52ce1bdf47ed", "type": "concept", "title": "Body-worn cameras"}, {"id": "667ad658-2247-4e0b-af1d-acf020307cc4", "type": "concept", "title": "Dash cameras"}, {"id": "8d455d3a-de8f-48fa-ab99-1c33d2b187f9", "type": "concept", "title": "License plate readers"}, {"id": "2519072b-2af4-4848-bd85-c2a9bf4f0fe6", "type": "concept", "title": "Shot detection"}, {"id": "99fe409d-1ce9-4b46-9e94-fd2f7fc0ff2b", "type": "concept", "title": "Drones"}, {"id": "ae8d229a-29f5-45fd-9298-68fbcfe1cb29", "type": "concept", "title": "CAD/RMS"}, {"id": "e225a83b-12a9-4093-a1ab-802649fe7cbc", "type": "concept", "title": "Mobile data terminals"}, {"id": "7e8958ab-90e0-4644-8134-40071e90833d", "type": "concept", "title": "Digital evidence systems"}], "description": "Students learn common police technologies and what problems they claim to solve."}, {"id": "c5a4898a-538b-4bfb-85fd-c80fa64332c6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Surveillance and analytics", "children": [{"id": "8ce5fd56-4ca9-4194-a641-b5ba22608d7e", "type": "concept", "title": "Facial recognition"}, {"id": "b67446d7-5c0e-4e99-80e5-937c383c200a", "type": "concept", "title": "Predictive policing"}, {"id": "169cbc0d-dce1-4bef-abc3-b2cadd2eb53e", "type": "concept", "title": "Social media monitoring"}, {"id": "995002e0-4219-4226-afbc-4aedcc8c01f2", "type": "concept", "title": "Real-time crime centers"}, {"id": "b86d4bfa-12aa-4768-8692-25d8d96b93f3", "type": "concept", "title": "Network analysis"}, {"id": "4579a26e-e230-49d3-a27c-845b09044f36", "type": "concept", "title": "Geofencing warrants"}, {"id": "514c446a-b835-488e-920b-d3e4d478b0eb", "type": "concept", "title": "Data fusion"}, {"id": "b2a95750-3416-41fe-80d0-5dc49b4f5e7f", "type": "concept", "title": "Algorithmic bias"}], "description": "Students evaluate surveillance and algorithmic tools that can expand police capacity and risk."}, {"id": "67402bbc-6f47-41c6-9ddd-f817bbe61d43", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Policy controls", "children": [{"id": "fc94822e-21eb-44fa-8b4e-f41ba9c171c8", "type": "concept", "title": "Use policy"}, {"id": "5e72040e-722d-47da-a4d9-dd69677fd2f1", "type": "concept", "title": "Retention rules"}, {"id": "13b01e2b-cfc6-4821-ac71-3b3138d9b253", "type": "concept", "title": "Audit logs"}, {"id": "b5183fb6-7329-4816-a4c2-39375dd560d8", "type": "concept", "title": "Access control"}, {"id": "17d0b033-c74f-441a-acc7-560b25be63bb", "type": "concept", "title": "Public notice"}, {"id": "2266cfd1-3121-4c29-9593-3942ef797982", "type": "concept", "title": "Impact assessments"}, {"id": "b27258b4-e03d-4a2d-be82-62f2a9d16540", "type": "concept", "title": "Vendor contracts"}, {"id": "3880cdf0-cd87-4c73-9042-e29ab9b82b33", "type": "concept", "title": "Cybersecurity"}], "description": "The point is to design governance before technology becomes routine."}]}, {"id": "143b1e1d-7f9c-46ef-b95e-a09feef2539d", "type": "topic", "title": "Specialized Policing Contexts and Vulnerable Populations", "description": "Police often encounter crises and vulnerabilities that require specialized responses beyond standard enforcement. Students learn how agencies handle mental health, domestic violence, youth, homelessness, immigration, and mass events.", "children": [{"id": "d7d6b23a-31c1-496c-9220-bbfe1f426943", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Crisis and behavioral health response", "children": [{"id": "74f42eaf-9b63-4bdd-9be7-609111875683", "type": "concept", "title": "Crisis intervention teams"}, {"id": "d12bfe37-6445-42b3-be70-5282bd4bca12", "type": "concept", "title": "Co-responder models"}, {"id": "084af57d-af96-4745-a8d6-7ba77fd9e322", "type": "concept", "title": "Mobile crisis teams"}, {"id": "a480f5e3-d1cc-4f13-becc-d02670daa4bc", "type": "concept", "title": "988 coordination"}, {"id": "0703dc04-3675-470c-9e02-a03992d5ba3e", "type": "concept", "title": "Excited delirium controversies"}, {"id": "a472b63d-a143-470a-ba9f-e352d208216b", "type": "concept", "title": "Suicide calls"}, {"id": "49a29dfd-9f67-4cdc-be3a-155375a7ede5", "type": "concept", "title": "Welfare checks"}, {"id": "6782f1e5-9778-4af0-9a24-b3138153677a", "type": "concept", "title": "Diversion"}], "description": "Students examine when police should respond, when alternatives are better, and how co-response models work."}, {"id": "b5ffe2da-1602-4978-bf80-69365e564a87", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Victim-centered and youth encounters", "children": [{"id": "3069258a-bed6-4bf3-9634-d05ffac84347", "type": "concept", "title": "Domestic violence"}, {"id": "3c80f06c-6216-4e54-82cc-50eddbf13c2d", "type": "concept", "title": "Sexual assault response"}, {"id": "28b1fe0f-ec0e-4359-8323-acc3dc4e98a1", "type": "concept", "title": "Human trafficking"}, {"id": "1d7281b4-6c91-46e2-bdca-34ad5f69aa43", "type": "concept", "title": "Child abuse"}, {"id": "209cb7d4-b850-414a-9b71-619583fd7f96", "type": "concept", "title": "Police-juvenile encounters"}, {"id": "48604af8-d04a-4344-a790-291e7146757e", "type": "concept", "title": "School resource officers"}, {"id": "cef57a2b-f3ce-47ae-bcaa-738004567d42", "type": "concept", "title": "Mandatory arrest"}, {"id": "f0aa64b9-f5a6-4bd9-b05f-61361a7b024a", "type": "concept", "title": "Victim services"}], "description": "Students learn how trauma, age, family dynamics, and victim safety shape police response."}, {"id": "707e0448-1ab5-4050-9784-a5a96af41c06", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Public order and special events", "children": [{"id": "f57b92ff-7c23-4832-89ea-f1a52764d90f", "type": "concept", "title": "Crowd control"}, {"id": "af8b76ed-4278-43b8-884c-00c2f2030121", "type": "concept", "title": "First Amendment activity"}, {"id": "899fc2cf-8478-4930-8b6e-2d3c3491f449", "type": "concept", "title": "Civil disorder units"}, {"id": "51f5cab7-97ed-42e9-8c3d-cc05bf89803f", "type": "concept", "title": "Mutual aid"}, {"id": "2882ca02-374a-42c6-a5ab-e25fd86f3c3b", "type": "concept", "title": "Incident command"}, {"id": "557ee97c-9996-4a82-aaab-c79f55d3d695", "type": "concept", "title": "Mass casualty response"}, {"id": "5ce4bf3e-08df-480e-81bc-653b39eadbc8", "type": "concept", "title": "Disaster policing"}, {"id": "f9ebac6a-ebd6-45ca-bf31-93750cf5253d", "type": "concept", "title": "After-action reporting"}], "description": "The goal is to understand crowd management, protest policing, and emergency coordination."}]}, {"id": "2d710e32-fc32-432e-a025-31a4155aa152", "type": "topic", "title": "Officer Wellness, Ethics, and Professional Identity", "description": "Healthy, ethical organizations are safer for officers and the public. This unit connects wellness, trauma, supervision, integrity, peer intervention, and professional identity.", "children": [{"id": "c97a2ba9-2916-47f8-a60a-ecc11391a0aa", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Officer wellness", "children": [{"id": "a4a89646-c2a2-437f-a86b-ca9355624a3d", "type": "concept", "title": "Shift work"}, {"id": "70666a2b-049e-46eb-883c-a585b0abe70b", "type": "concept", "title": "Sleep deprivation"}, {"id": "3ab10a54-2587-4ddb-9a70-a45079036c3d", "type": "concept", "title": "Hypervigilance"}, {"id": "e8677963-a3c2-4408-9ed4-506da149c501", "type": "concept", "title": "Trauma exposure"}, {"id": "64e49f4e-5e3a-4507-8b22-19b0f1207060", "type": "concept", "title": "Suicide risk"}, {"id": "d32e572a-75c6-4db9-8ae1-5acd4f70f0ff", "type": "concept", "title": "Peer support"}, {"id": "5328025b-5895-478a-9d3f-4681e5b09c0e", "type": "concept", "title": "Employee assistance programs"}, {"id": "c996f8e3-3335-4110-bdc3-72b87389816c", "type": "concept", "title": "Family stress"}], "description": "Students learn how stress and trauma affect behavior, retention, and decision-making."}, {"id": "953b1039-e236-4ae4-8d50-0a39cdc1a75d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Police ethics", "children": [{"id": "b3d494c3-1f65-4cac-88e1-3003a1564644", "type": "concept", "title": "Noble cause corruption"}, {"id": "5501723e-a18a-47e3-9ed9-b9ee7060167a", "type": "concept", "title": "Gratuities"}, {"id": "ff33ca1b-a919-48b5-8d89-514cc624ad9a", "type": "concept", "title": "Conflicts of interest"}, {"id": "93bc471b-94e3-42cf-953c-c1e83ea9a818", "type": "concept", "title": "Bias"}, {"id": "a14306a2-a25c-4952-8dc5-ad7d328d89da", "type": "concept", "title": "Truthfulness"}, {"id": "8ea2ebe1-657d-472a-951c-bbfae249121c", "type": "concept", "title": "Brady/Giglio disclosure"}, {"id": "7e51ba6c-9d41-499a-846c-ee0b45a8f9c1", "type": "concept", "title": "Duty to report"}, {"id": "748e24f4-ff7a-44cc-824e-e4855122cbcb", "type": "concept", "title": "Duty to intervene"}], "description": "Students examine integrity problems that arise from discretion, loyalty, and authority."}, {"id": "6c6722f1-6813-4df3-9df9-2bf045bf397c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Leadership and culture change", "children": [{"id": "f521a7bb-2ef5-4e4f-87d7-4c79d007e685", "type": "concept", "title": "First-line supervision"}, {"id": "392a0963-16b9-4712-a27c-1b2bc87e1790", "type": "concept", "title": "Roll-call training"}, {"id": "ee08addf-ec22-4fe4-abb8-11cc6bbc6aa3", "type": "concept", "title": "Mentorship"}, {"id": "561a3a66-5fde-4b3a-a81f-92d5b93b927d", "type": "concept", "title": "Peer intervention"}, {"id": "bb1b7cf2-a41c-4eca-ae92-b193d4826478", "type": "concept", "title": "Accountability culture"}, {"id": "194c865e-8c14-4831-98e8-8b267b9104d2", "type": "concept", "title": "Learning organization"}, {"id": "da631f2f-4d19-4689-980a-19154fe6eb87", "type": "concept", "title": "CompStat pressure"}, {"id": "e9706147-2b71-4e69-854b-6d06b15aef5e", "type": "concept", "title": "Organizational justice"}], "description": "The point is to understand how supervisors and executives shape norms."}]}, {"id": "38594b0f-5605-4ba3-b8d5-87d2c00e32fd", "type": "topic", "title": "Homeland Security, Federalism, and Interagency Policing", "description": "Modern policing operates across local, state, federal, and private boundaries. Students learn how homeland security, intelligence, task forces, and interagency partnerships affect local policing.", "children": [{"id": "30f80a0c-e64d-42ce-9d84-fe6219e359d4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Federalism and task forces", "children": [{"id": "5ac361f7-b17c-4dd7-b31c-b1ba933637e4", "type": "concept", "title": "Joint task forces"}, {"id": "79e5aa7c-8a4e-446f-9f8f-ef095375ec30", "type": "concept", "title": "Fusion centers"}, {"id": "58cc7d1a-388a-45b8-81ad-9761afec7f59", "type": "concept", "title": "FBI partnerships"}, {"id": "0ebefdcd-c14f-426f-824f-178cba4cc224", "type": "concept", "title": "DEA task forces"}, {"id": "d432e2a9-d347-4db0-8b1d-c44bcea62215", "type": "concept", "title": "ATF partnerships"}, {"id": "0e464804-d0c8-4762-87b3-854db9fd56c6", "type": "concept", "title": "U.S. Marshals"}, {"id": "b48e597d-8051-440d-bddc-74197d3e238b", "type": "concept", "title": "State fusion centers"}, {"id": "26bfd345-5b81-47ec-9274-acc5e9149692", "type": "concept", "title": "Memoranda of understanding"}], "description": "Students learn how agencies share authority, resources, and information."}, {"id": "3862a433-4c17-4e4f-8490-0846f4dbc50a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Homeland security role", "children": [{"id": "1aab003d-26eb-48e2-a6c0-481f9badbae2", "type": "concept", "title": "Terrorism prevention"}, {"id": "8d100042-85cd-48fb-b965-f0424bcbf95a", "type": "concept", "title": "Critical infrastructure"}, {"id": "cc3b1353-a8d2-46d7-b2c1-139095532271", "type": "concept", "title": "Threat assessment"}, {"id": "f175f7e8-3523-4771-b4ca-896831d5f3de", "type": "concept", "title": "Suspicious activity reporting"}, {"id": "4933de3e-4ac4-4f02-b135-b40e3b6e3ece", "type": "concept", "title": "National Incident Management System"}, {"id": "807f3a09-046c-4513-b803-25d942be1713", "type": "concept", "title": "Emergency operations centers"}, {"id": "5a6ec9bf-0c74-4b29-855d-83795ba12083", "type": "concept", "title": "Intelligence liaison officers"}], "description": "Students examine how terrorism prevention and emergency preparedness changed local policing."}, {"id": "23f347d8-53c0-48e5-8eac-3220a7787235", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Civil liberties tensions", "children": [{"id": "4d4d3231-c078-4637-b6c4-bd8636810e79", "type": "concept", "title": "Religious profiling"}, {"id": "be8aa29b-675c-4af8-9f52-1ba4eadccd05", "type": "concept", "title": "Political surveillance"}, {"id": "9698f246-5f14-43f5-85db-686bd1794ac3", "type": "concept", "title": "Immigrant communities"}, {"id": "f645f075-fd0b-499a-8f00-f8fb58a319f5", "type": "concept", "title": "First Amendment concerns"}, {"id": "3def8781-0db5-4bb9-b549-424e989c9249", "type": "concept", "title": "Privacy"}, {"id": "bae60725-d432-46bf-a6c5-e29c42f0cd31", "type": "concept", "title": "Watchlists"}, {"id": "a3df7504-7953-4b66-900c-945b49ccc946", "type": "concept", "title": "Information sharing"}, {"id": "1bf5b388-27d5-42fa-a023-39cfae043dd1", "type": "concept", "title": "Oversight"}], "description": "The goal is to balance prevention with rights, transparency, and community trust."}]}, {"id": "2f83354f-aa74-41da-bb08-ea9d40b41ae1", "type": "topic", "title": "Contemporary Reform, Innovation, and Capstone Policy Design", "description": "The final unit asks students to synthesize history, law, operations, data, legitimacy, and ethics into a realistic reform agenda. Students design policy that can actually be implemented and evaluated.", "children": [{"id": "82446344-f54b-4a0e-b124-7cfd271fc58b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Reform models", "children": [{"id": "c9dd9c23-6ded-4151-8768-24b9a6085e07", "type": "concept", "title": "Community violence intervention"}, {"id": "56174d56-d85f-4306-9bc7-675d1a879700", "type": "concept", "title": "Focused deterrence"}, {"id": "c233a57d-fc4a-42a3-bbfe-d76944262392", "type": "concept", "title": "Decriminalization"}, {"id": "b5f50a9b-1a1c-43c7-8e74-f259abc53f60", "type": "concept", "title": "Deflection"}, {"id": "4bfb13fb-8983-40e6-961b-7c9259164ce1", "type": "concept", "title": "Unbundling police functions"}, {"id": "846f287e-bf10-44dd-915d-320450d533e8", "type": "concept", "title": "Civilian crisis response"}, {"id": "5adb56ad-e8ce-4ae0-bbe1-a4a66f82b8ad", "type": "concept", "title": "Consent decree reform"}, {"id": "dfd7111d-f295-4a9d-8c89-bab93a1b1e7d", "type": "concept", "title": "Accreditation"}], "description": "Students compare major reform ideas and the evidence or assumptions behind them."}, {"id": "6026f798-019a-43cb-893e-74f95dd7dade", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Implementation and evaluation", "children": [{"id": "62d56039-0411-44ac-b648-08ec398674cd", "type": "concept", "title": "Theory of change"}, {"id": "d6cbbd23-20a2-4fac-b01d-e3f6e018fe4f", "type": "concept", "title": "Stakeholder analysis"}, {"id": "bb892afe-2f17-4558-8935-c84fdc56616a", "type": "concept", "title": "Implementation plan"}, {"id": "31784bfa-e62e-4e49-9590-62a984902429", "type": "concept", "title": "Training plan"}, {"id": "05ab0dcc-e470-402e-834f-037c781b007b", "type": "concept", "title": "Budget"}, {"id": "d659c1fe-5bd8-4d1c-88ba-1ec7172199bb", "type": "concept", "title": "Union considerations"}, {"id": "2ca9b9c0-0a66-47ec-b908-5173ebc3b66a", "type": "concept", "title": "Performance dashboard"}, {"id": "9410304f-3bd5-4645-8a12-62a7701b7e44", "type": "concept", "title": "Evaluation design"}], "description": "Students learn that reform succeeds or fails through supervision, incentives, labor relations, and measurement."}, {"id": "d3ebd1c5-eb25-4a7d-962c-2206ff504a2f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Capstone policy design", "children": [{"id": "71d1e9e4-b877-4054-adfc-5b1e4bf403ce", "type": "concept", "title": "Problem statement"}, {"id": "a742302f-e5ee-4e7c-97bd-e2e04a66f390", "type": "concept", "title": "Root-cause analysis"}, {"id": "2d57b745-3d25-43d1-9c3b-723de3d06783", "type": "concept", "title": "Policy memo"}, {"id": "c6d1bb67-70cc-4c0e-9cd4-1860a87551b1", "type": "concept", "title": "Community engagement plan"}, {"id": "1ab3c9c5-4ec2-4fcc-a126-8ca04f2fdc5e", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk assessment"}, {"id": "b78ba311-a298-4